    "overview": "Nobody hands you credibility with your license. You build it in month four the same way experienced agents built theirs — by knowing more about the market than the person sitting across from you, by borrowing the strength of the people around you, and by showing up in the same place long enough to be recognized. This month is about closing the knowledge gap fast and honestly, without ever pretending to be something you're not.",
