    "overview": "You have spent six months learning how to find people. This month is about what happens next: qualifying them honestly, sitting down at their kitchen table, and coming home with a signature. Listings are the part of the business you control, and the agent who can price a home and hold that price is the agent who builds a career instead of a lucky year.",
